       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TPCO04.
      * COMPANY BO - REGISTER SHARE PCT, CAPITAL AND PROFITS
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-SHARES-HELD            PIC 9(9) VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-SHARES-ISSUED          PIC 9(9) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-CAPITAL-PCT            PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-PROFIT-PCT             PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-CONTROL-FLAG           PIC X VALUE 'N'.
       01  WS-IS-BO                  PIC X VALUE 'N'.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           ACCEPT WS-SHARES-HELD
           ACCEPT WS-SHARES-ISSUED
           ACCEPT WS-CAPITAL-PCT
           ACCEPT WS-PROFIT-PCT
           ACCEPT WS-CONTROL-FLAG
           PERFORM 2000-PERCENT
           DISPLAY 'BO: ' WS-IS-BO
           STOP RUN.
       2000-PERCENT.
      * SHARE TEST IS EXACT: HELD/ISSUED ABOVE 25 PERCENT.
           IF WS-SHARES-HELD * 100 > 25 * WS-SHARES-ISSUED
              OR WS-CAPITAL-PCT > 25
              OR WS-PROFIT-PCT > 25 OR WS-CONTROL-FLAG = 'Y'
              MOVE 'Y' TO WS-IS-BO
           ELSE
              MOVE 'N' TO WS-IS-BO
           END-IF.
